          :resolution-capture "Before assigning capacityErr=ErrUnavailable, record local_allowed_without_local_denied only when both hypothetical policy.ResolveExecutionMode calls actually ran, local call succeeded and Allowed, and the without-local call either returned an error or explicitly not Allowed. Record other for other completed outcomes; not_evaluated when not run. Do not infer this result from workflowProfile.RequireLocalOnly or a session constraint. Store actual original decision's two explicit deny-capability memberships independently. Policy evaluation error means no asserted denied capabilities or decision version."
